Embedded bmake
==============

Source: https://github.com/xnuports/bmake
Revision: 65b4adf01a42a6497cbf3238292330776170a36e
License: BSD-3-Clause (see LICENSE)

Only the source and headers required by the portable bmake engine are
vendored. The iOS integration:

* exposes ios_make_run as an in-process callback API;
* forces single-job compatibility mode;
* redirects recipes to the host callback;
* rejects shell command substitution;
* removes fork and exec paths from the linked framework; and
* resets upstream global state so the API can be called repeatedly.

The Perl bridge supports pure-Perl MakeMaker recipes. It intentionally
rejects compiler, linker, arbitrary shell, and process-launch recipes.